## 📅 PHASE 10 — PRODUCTION HARDENING (Week 16-17)

### Priority: CRITICAL | Status: ✅ COMPLETED

**Security Enhancements:**

```
✅ Rate Limiting
   ├─ Global: 100 req/15min per IP
   ├─ Auth endpoints: 5 req/15min
   ├─ Payment endpoints: 10 req/15min
   └─ Redis-backed rate limit store

✅ Input Validation
   ├─ Joi schemas for all inputs
   ├─ MongoDB injection prevention (express-mongo-sanitize)
   ├─ XSS protection (xss-clean)
   └─ File upload validation

✅ Authentication Hardening
   ├─ Account lockout (5 failed attempts)
   ├─ JWT secret rotation strategy
   ├─ Refresh token rotation
   └─ Session invalidation on logout

✅ HTTPS Enforcement
   └─ Redirect HTTP to HTTPS in production
```

**Concurrency & Reliability:**

```
✅ Distributed Locking
   ├─ Redis-based locks with TTL
   ├─ Automatic lock release
   └─ Retry logic with exponential backoff

✅ Idempotency Keys
   ├─ Webhook deduplication
   ├─ Payment retry protection
   └─ 24-hour cache TTL

✅ MongoDB Transactions
   ├─ Multi-document ACID guarantees
   ├─ Automatic rollback on failure
   └─ Transaction timeout handling

✅ Optimistic Locking
   ├─ Mongoose version control
   └─ Retry on version conflict
```

**Caching Strategy:**

```
✅ Redis Caching
   ├─ Product catalog (10 min TTL)
   ├─ User sessions (7 days TTL)
   ├─ Analytics (1 hour TTL)
   └─ Rate limit counters (15 min TTL)

✅ Cache Invalidation
   ├─ TTL-based expiration
   ├─ Manual invalidation on updates
   └─ Pattern-based invalidation
```

**Monitoring & Logging:**

```
✅ Winston Logging
   ├─ Structured JSON logs
   ├─ Log rotation (5MB, 5 files)
   ├─ Separate error logs
   └─ Log levels: error, warn, info, http, debug

✅ Morgan HTTP Logging
   ├─ Request/response logging
   ├─ Response time tracking
   └─ Custom format for production

✅ Health Checks
   ├─ /health (basic liveness)
   ├─ /health/detailed (MongoDB, Redis status)
   └─ Memory, CPU metrics

✅ Sentry Integration
   ├─ Error tracking
   ├─ Performance monitoring
   └─ Source maps
```

